k risk if the discovery API changes at GA.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-5 (P2): Job placement can prefer GPU-topology-aligned nodes when the cluster exposes topology information. This investigation determines whether the topology discovery HLR-5 depends on is mature enough to build on this release, and gates the HLR-5 implementation.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":46842,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-89be6101d3983008","agent_id":"a87ab15cfd5e9f59c","session_id":"f72e5a6b-50db-4e86-b979-c3cde993f59c","uuid":"54343da6-c2a7-4b0d-a2e3-2071236e3d10","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:22:31.389Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9005"}
