eft partially scheduled and not killed mid-partial-schedule).\n- Configuration is reversible: reverting the admission settings restores prior admission behavior for running and pending workloads.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): Multi-node training jobs are admitted all-or-nothing — primary coverage, via the Kueue-native path selected by the gang-admission investigation.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":49848,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-89be6101d3983008","agent_id":"a87ab15cfd5e9f59c","session_id":"f72e5a6b-50db-4e86-b979-c3cde993f59c","uuid":"a2662185-d3df-4cac-be49-dde5dd078397","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:23:41.798Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9005"}
